{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09513","headline":"李陵别苏武 · 刘湾","name":"李陵别苏武","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉武爱边功，李陵提步卒。\n转战单于庭，身随汉军没。\n李陵不爱死，心存归汉阙。\n誓欲还国恩，不爲匈奴屈。\n身辱家已无，长居虎狼窟。\n胡天无春风，虏地多积雪。\n穷阴愁杀人，况与苏武别。\n发声天地哀，执手肺肠绝。\n白日爲我愁，阴云爲我结。\n生爲汉宫臣，死爲胡地骨。\n万里长相思，终身望南月。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘湾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09513.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09513","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}